{"id":1140801,"name":"派因·审查Ⅰ","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"派因·审查Ⅰ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1140801]}],"trial":{"trial_id":140801,"stage":"阶段1","unlock_time":"2025-02-27 14:00:00","diary1":"不久前，你成功在一场公开演讲上抓获在新城大选中肆意传播谣言、造成骚乱的禁闭者派因，并将其带回MBCC。\n　　然而短短几日的时间里，她就已经给你发来了十数封不合规范的外出申请书，令你不堪其扰。","diary2":"你从审查中得知，有匿名人士向刺探者之眼举报谢德镇事务专员黑尔的数项罪行，并提供了一系列相关证据。派因此次申请外出的理由正是为了前往谢德镇进行实地调查，验证这些指控的真伪。\n　　最终经过一番拉扯与讨价还价，你终于与派因达成一致——你批准了她外出申请，但作为条件，你也需要陪同前往。","evidence":[{"ID":260695,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260696,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240801023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dial